Package: wb-vout-watchdog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3-paho-mqtt,
         python3-libgpiod
Description: Wiren Board Vout undervoltage watchdog
 Supervises input power (Vin) and gates the switched Vout line on WB
 controllers. Cuts Vout on a dangerous undervoltage and requires a fresh
 external MQTT confirmation before re-enabling it.
